    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file named `select_voice.py` that integrates with a concrete external provider to list or select a voice for a target locale. I will use the Amazon Polly service for this integration, as it is a well-known service for text-to-speech conversion with various voices available. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789866391922,
          "start": 1789866389229
